<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Welcome to Nova Bank</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6; }
        .container { width: 100%; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }
        .header { background-color: #1a365d; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; }
        .account-badge { background-color: #edf2f7; border-left: 4px solid #3182ce; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #718096; text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; padding-top: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>NOVA BANK</h1>
        <h3>Your Trusted Financial Partner</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <h2>Welcome to Nova Bank!</h2>
        <p>Dear {{ .FirstName }} {{ .LastName }},</p>
        <p>Thank you for choosing Nova Bank for your banking needs. We're excited to have you on board and look forward to helping you achieve your financial goals.</p>

        <div class="account-badge">
            <strong>Your Current Account Number:</strong>
            <h3 style="margin: 5px 0; color: #2b6cb0; letter-spacing: 1px;">{{ .AccountNumber }}</h3>
            <small>Status: Active&nbsp;&nbsp;Currency: {{ .Currency }}</small>
        </div>

        <p>Your account has been successfully created and is ready for use right away.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>© 2026 Nova Bank, Ltd. 123 Financial District. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>This email was sent to {{ .Email }}</p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
